# Local run output -- never commit: report dumps contain real mod names and
# real install paths. Deliberately NOT a blanket `*.txt`: fixtures/*.txt and
# tests/fixtures/*.txt are tracked acceptance data and must stay trackable.
# Patterns are root-anchored so nothing under a fixtures dir can ever match.
